--- !u!114 &92802331
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 92802329}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 1e31f65aee5839242995a6090a882a59, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialougePanel: {fileID: 1220307779}
  dialougeText: {fileID: 1036953638}
  dialouge:
  - Oh Hello don't be alarmed i am not one of them.
  - I am Sir Rex Midi
  - I assume you have come here for these rogue knight investigation.
  - Well I have some news for you. These are not actual knights, to elaborate these
    are the creation of a knight who wanted to rule the whole world.
  - The human body is made up of 65% Oxygem, 18% Carbon, 9.5% Hydrogen, 3.2% Nitrogen,
    1.5% Calcium -
  - 1.2% Phosphorus, 0.4% Potassium, 0.2% Sulfur, 0.2% Sodium, 0.2% Chlorine, 0.1%
    Magnesium, and other elements that i cannot even name.
  - 62% Water, 16% Protein, 16% Fat, 6% Minerals and 1% Carbohydrates.
  - The rouge knight brought these elements and performed a full human construction
    on an atomic level, but what the element he was missing was Soul.
  - There is no scientific way to create a soul, so he left these failed experiments
    to roam freely and their brain has its motor functions and feeding functions
    working, which is not a good news for us.
  - Apparently he is currently searching for a Philosopher's Stone.
  - I don't know much details but one thing I know is that it is supposed to be in
    a supersolid state.
  - A supersolid is a fascinating state of matter that combines the properties of
    both a solid and a superfluid. Unlike regular solids, which have a rigid, fixed
    structure, supersolids can exhibit frictionless flow, like a superfluid.
  - That's all that I know of about his intenstions. I must not distract you more.
  - To be honest I came here to visit this grave of my brave friend and fellow Knight
    SIr Lancelot but enough chatter. You should be on you way Sir Anzo.
  - Hope you succeed on your path.
  continueButton: {fileID: 533289076}
  wordSpeed: 0.05
  isPlayerInRange: 0
