  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialougePanel: {fileID: 1220307779}
  dialougeText: {fileID: 1036953638}
  dialouge:
  - Greetings Sir Anzo.
  - Why am I here? My Knights have died in this field, I came here to pay my respects.
  - I am here all because of them, My kingdom is safe because of them and its inhabitants.
  - The best I can do for these fallen knights is to pay my respect and mourn their
    loss.
  - SIr Anzo.
  - Let our knight's sacrifice not be in vain.
  - This is not an order from a King to his Knight, but a plea from a man to another.
  - Save us all, Sir Anzo.
  - I, King Manuel Neur Of The House Of the Lion will pray for you to succeed in
    your path.
  continueButton: {fileID: 533289076}
  wordSpeed: 0.05
  isPlayerInRange: 0
