--- !u!114 &1061000632
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1061000630}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 1e31f65aee5839242995a6090a882a59, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialougePanel: {fileID: 1220307779}
  dialougeText: {fileID: 1036953638}
  dialouge:
  - You are quite brave to approach me without any fear.
  - I know who you are and I also know you've lost you memory.
  - I can recover you memory but you need to do something for me.
  - A simple quid pro quo.
  - The Knight who made these artificial humans is searching for a stone that can
    seemingly make anything out of thin air and can even turn stone into gold.
  - Philosophers Stone is what you call it, well I am really curious about it.
  - So here is my proposition, get me that stone and I will help you recover you
    memories.
  - Hmmmm, a witch told you it will recover by itself.
  - Ha ha ha hah hahahaha.
  - How long will it take until that happens, days, weeks, months, years????
  - So you do the caluculations youself.
  - Take your time to think about my offer.
  - Sorry, I have not introduced myself.
  - I am the lord of the second circle of Hell, Lord Gandmaru.
  - Until we meet again Sir Anzo.
  continueButton: {fileID: 533289076}
  wordSpeed: 0.05
  isPlayerInRange: 0
