--- !u!114 &1086847492
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1086847491}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 1e31f65aee5839242995a6090a882a59, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialougePanel: {fileID: 1220307779}
  dialougeText: {fileID: 1036953638}
  dialouge:
  - Sir Anzo!!!! Thank god you are okay!!!
  - Huh?? Why do you look so confused? Do you not recgonise me? Its me Shiva, your
    apprentice!!!
  - My god it seems that you have suffered from amnesia. You do know our job right?
  - 'Well let me explain it to you anyway. We are Monster Hunters. '
  - You specially are a Knight Of The House Of The Lion.
  - We came here to find out about rogue knights that have been terrorising the nearby
    city.
  - I have not gone through the proper training and studies to fight monsters.
  - But you are a very Special Knight.
  - Every human has some innate abilities to control objects and things around their
    surroundings.
  - My innate ability is to control oxygen up to a certain radius.
  - Your ability however is really powerful.
  - You can control sub-atomic particles and then force the electrons into the nucleus
    of the atom forming a neutrino.
  - After creating enough neutrinos you can release the particle in a form of an
    orb and when it touches an enemy it explodes into a neutrino blast.
  - I heard there was a witch named Isak nearby see if you can find her and if you
    do ask her how to trigger your abilities.
  - Oh and also use CTRL to perform sword slashes, you can also perfrom it mid air.
  - I'll rest here, I've borken my foot and I doubt I'll be of any use so you go
    on ahead Sir Anzo.
  - Farewell.
  continueButton: {fileID: 533289076}
  wordSpeed: 0.05
  isPlayerInRange: 0
