--- !u!114 &1421405933
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1421405931}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 1e31f65aee5839242995a6090a882a59, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialougePanel: {fileID: 1220307779}
  dialougeText: {fileID: 1036953638}
  dialouge:
  - So you've finally reached me.
  - Why do you look so..................
  - Ahh now I get it you don't recognise me. Well let me introduce myself. I am Darth
    Isak, the creater of these rogue knights.
  - Hmmm now I seem to alarm you don't I.
  - What did you say??? What I am doing is terrible??
  - Well look who's talking!!!!!! You think I of all people have forgotten who you
    are????
  - You have no right to lecture me about what is right and what is wrong.
  - Since you've lost your memory I won't spare you the trauma of getting to know
    what you've done in your past, that is really something to look forward to.
  - (Sir Anzo tries to attack with his sword but is deflected violently back to him.
    He barely stopped the sword slashing through him.)
  - That is of no use Anzo, my innate ability allows for me to control vectors up
    to a certain radius. So don't waste you time.
  - Well let me tell you a story before we part ways.
  - Once up on a time, there was a lamb who was good friends with another female
    lamb.
  - They were very playful and loving towards eachother, the whole herd knew about
    that, but the male lamb was very michievious often causing a lot of troubles
    for the herd.
  - Because he was friends with a bunch of lions.
  - The lamb was often told to stop staying with the lions but he never listened.
  - 'One day the lions attacked the herd. Killed hundreds leaving no one. The lions
    offered the lamb to save one, either the rest of the herd or his beloved female
    lamb. '
  - Guess what he chose??
  - Of course he chose his beloved, and the lions started killing the rest of the
    herd infront of them, the screams and plea for help could be heard up to the
    next village.
  - 'But the lions were just playing with the lamb. '
  - They killed the female lamb right infront of him, saying "We don't befriend our
    food."
  - The lamb was petrified as the lions leave the scene.
  - But there was another lamb who survived the massacre. A lamb who saw his whole
    herd gets massacred and swore revenge on the lions, the judas lamb, and the farmer.
    A farmer who was supposed to take care of his subjects and save them.
  - The lamb who caused the whole massacred swore to never walk down the wrong path,
    and decided to dedicate his life to be a thoughtful being.
  - So I want to ask you a question. What would you choose Sir Anzo???
  - Sir Anzo Answers. If I am given a choice to chose between a greater and a lesser
    evil. I refuse to choose at all.
  - Well this world does not work that way SIr Anzo.
  - The next time we meet only one will be standing. I hope you recover your memories,
    slowly.
  - I just could not wait to see you then.
  continueButton: {fileID: 533289076}
  wordSpeed: 0.05
  isPlayerInRange: 0
