  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 1e31f65aee5839242995a6090a882a59, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialougePanel: {fileID: 1220307779}
  dialougeText: {fileID: 1036953638}
  dialouge:
  - Hey human.
  - Chill out dude I'm not gonna rob ya!!!!
  - Well at least not today.
  - So lets cut to the real meat and potato of the situation at hand.
  - I am Ankit. A goblin, as you can see I have some info you can use.
  - This is not a quid pro quo, don't worry. Aligning myself with you is the best
    course of action.
  - So, I heard a Hob Goblin talk about a large fiery guy searching for capable men,
    said he offers a lot of goodies if he sees you fit for the job.
  - And that stupid old Hob sent some of the best Goblin Champions to him, but none
    of them returned later the old Hob ended up dead.
  - Rumors are that the fiery red guy is Krampus. The flippin Christmas Demon.
  - That's all I got in terms of info, but if I am sure you can find them on your
    way.
  - Until then farewell, lets hope I see you again so that you can repay me. I mean
    living with a group is a pain, but living alone is not too good either.
  continueButton: {fileID: 533289076}
  wordSpeed: 0.05
  isPlayerInRange: 0
