--- !u!114 &1888454201
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1888454196}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 1e31f65aee5839242995a6090a882a59, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialougePanel: {fileID: 1220307779}
  dialougeText: {fileID: 1036953638}
  dialouge:
  - Hello there!!!!
  - Now Piss Off!!!!
  - Sorry for that. I am Anmol Malle The Witch of the Leiden forest.
  - Ah wait!!! I sense you have come for help. Well you have encountered me on a
    good day, tell me what you want.
  - I see so you've lost you memories. But you still want to complete your task.
  - A true Knight indeed. Well i cannnot help you much in the memory part, do not
    worry the brain heals itself you just have to give it time.
  - The Hippocampus is responsible for memories and there is no reason fo me to tinker
    with it.
  - Well I can plant some knowledge in you brain.
  - You want to use your innate ability of neutrino blast. Very well then here you
    go.
  - ...................................
  - There you can now use it by pressing F.
  - Go on now before I lose my patience.
  continueButton: {fileID: 533289076}
  wordSpeed: 0.05
  isPlayerInRange: 0
